'''MARCO''' (マルコ, ''Maruko'', '''Marco''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = MARCO
|image = E 192.png
|appearance = [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 180¢ - 711¢
}}

==Enemy==
A very pathetic enemy, extremely low health, damage and range makes this enemy seem like nothing. This enemy serves no threat to any player that comes across it. Use anything to defeat it as it will most likely die in one hit anyway.

